# GTA VI PC Port Race — live tracker

## 👉 [Open the live tracker](https://bc160201983.github.io/gta6-pc-port-tracker/)

[Race scene](https://bc160201983.github.io/gta6-pc-port-tracker/stream.html) · [Leonida Reloaded](https://bc160201983.github.io/gta6-pc-port-tracker/leonida.html)

Unofficial fan dashboard tracking community efforts to run GTA VI natively on PC:
Belobug, ZETTROX, hyphennn, Uilian, VIctory, Leonida Reloaded, XCL, Xbox2Windows and TuxBox.
Scores use [PortWatch VI](https://portwatch-vi.xyz/#race)'s public scale (Playable = 50%, the
whole game finished = 100%); pull requests and commits come from each project's public repository.

Contains no game code, game files or assets. Not affiliated with Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive.

Pages: `index.html` (dashboard) · `stream.html` (race scene) · `leonida.html` (Leonida Reloaded)
